a><model namespace=\\\\\\\"ai.sample.CustomerRecords\\\\\\\"><variables><variable name=\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\"key\\\\\\\" /><variable name=\\\\\\\"tenure\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\"int\\\\\\\" collapse=\\\\\\\"Monotone\\\\\\\"><unit basis=\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\one\\\\\\\" namespace=\\\\\\\"D-SI\\\\\\\" /></variable><variable name=\\\\\\\"monthly\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\"double\\\\\\\" collapse=\\\\\\\"Monotone\\\\\\\"><unit basis=\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\one\\\\\\\" namespace=\\\\\\\"D-SI\\\\\\\" /></variable><variable name=\\\\\\\"churned\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\"bool\\\\\\\" /><variable name=\\\\\\\"signedUp\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\"utcdatetime\\\\\\\" /></variables></model><…\\\"}]},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"Global/Files/AiDesign/UnitTests/07 Delegate Chain.xml\\\",\\\"runs\\\":[{\\\"when\\\":\\\"2026-11-07T04:38:59Z\\\",\\\"version\\\":\\\"v0.1.260919.0229\\\",\\\"endpoint\\\":\\\"portal\\\",\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"status\\\":\\\"200\\\",\\\"ms\\\":384,\\\"bytes\\\":1442,\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Session 3AEA59… · user D72DB9… · 1 action, 1 item\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"<Response>\\\\r\\\\n  <Status>OK</Status>\\\\r\\\\n  <Seraphim.Internet.Session Key=\\\\\\\"3AEA592FE35B5DF6\\\\\\\">\\\\r\\\\n    <Variables>\\\\r\\\\n      <User>D72DB9140CDD4152</User>\\\\r\\\\n      <Site>A7BBBD758705A7EC</Site>\\\\r\\\\n      <CreationDate Collapse=\\\\\\\"Earliest\\\\\\\">11/7/2026 4:38:59 AM</CreationDate>\\\\r\\\\n      <LastTouched Collapse=\\\\\\\"Latest\\\\\\\">11/7/2026 4:38:59 AM</LastTouched>\\\\r\\\\n      <DeliverySpeed Unit=\\\\\\\"m/s\\\\\\\" Collapse=\\\\\\\"Monotone\\\\\\\">2.89</DeliverySpeed>\\\\r\\\\n      <Driver Collapse=\\\\\\\"Vote\\\\\\\">Gonk</Driver>\\\\r\\\\n      <Deliveries Collapse=\\\\\\\"Sum\\\\\\\">33</Deliveries>\\\\r\\\\n    </Variables>\\\\r\\\\n    <Actions>\\\\r\\\\n      <Action Key=\\\\\\\"5F54B0E2496754CA\\\\\\\" />\\\\r\\\\n    </Actions>\\\\r\\\\n    <Items>\\\\r\\\\n      <Item Key=\\\\\\\"A4F66F16F752C922\\\\\\\" />\\\\r\\\\n    </Items>\\\\r\\\\n  </Seraphim.Internet.Session>\\\\r\\\\n</Response>\\\",\\\"sent\\\":\\\"<?xml version=\\\\\\\"1.0\\\\\\\" encoding=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"?><xaiml version=\\\\\\\"1\\\\\\\"><name>07 Delegate Chain</name><gorp name=\\\\\\\"07 Delegate Chain\\\\\\\"><comment view=\\\\\\\"class\\\\\\\">One algorithm hands over to another. First's step carries delegate=\\\\\\\"ut.chain.Second\\\\\\\", which is the only algorithm-to-algorithm tie SAI has, and the dashed arrow between them is DERIVED from that step.\\\\n\\\\nBoth algorithms read In and write Out, so the chain is closed at both ends.</comment><expect>Check finds nothing and Run comes back OK.\\\\n\\\\nPoint the delegate at a namespace that does not exist and Check must report the broken hand-off by name.</expect><model namespace=\\\\\\\"ut.chain.In\\\\\\\"><variables><variable name=\\\\\\\"value\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\"double\\\\\\\" collapse=\\\\\\\"Monotone\\\\\\\"><unit basis=\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\one\\\\\\\" namespace=\\\\\\\"D-SI\\\\\\\" /></variable></variables></model><model namespace=\\\\\\\"ut.chain.Out\\\\\\\"><variables><variable name=\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\"double\\\\\\\" collapse=\\\\\\\"Monotone\\\\\\\"><unit basis=\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\one\\\\\\\" namespace=\\\\\\\"D-SI\\\\\\\" /></variable></variables></model><algorithm namespace=\\\\\\\"ut.chain.First\\\\\\\"><input model=\\\\\\\"ut.chain.In\\\\\\\" /><output model=\\\\\\\"ut.chain.Out\\\\\\\" /><operations><operation name=\\\\\\\"start\\\\\\\" returns=\\\\\\\"double\\\\\\\" /></operations><function><expressions><expression sequence=\\\\\\\"0\\\\\\\" name=\\\\\\\"hand over\\\\\\\" delegate=\\\\\\\"ut.chain.Second\\\\\\\" limit=\\\\\\\"1\\\\\\\" />…\\\"}]},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"Global/Files/AiDesign/UnitTests/08 Guarded Flow.xml\\\",\\\"runs\\\":[{\\\"when\\\":\\\"2026-11-07T04:40:05Z\\\",\\\"version\\\":\\\"v0.1.260919.0229\\\",\\\"endpoint\\\":\\\"portal\\\",\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"status\\\":\\\"200\\\",\\\"ms\\\":119,\\\"bytes\\\":1944,\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Session 759E95… · user 63BB13… · 1 action, 1 item\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"<Response>\\\\r\\\\n  <Status>OK</Status>\\\\r\\\\n  <Seraphim.Internet.Session Key=\\\\\\\"759E9519BB9B3CDD\\\\\\\">\\\\r\\\\n    <Variables>\\\\r\\\\n      <User>63BB13DB9F0AF017</User>\\\\r\\\\n      <Site>088AB7BF7E0DAF97</Site>\\\\r\\\\n      <CreationDate Collapse=\\\\\\\"Earliest\\\\\\\">11/7/2026 4:40:05 AM</CreationDate>\\\\r\\\\n      <LastTouched Collapse=\\\\\\\"Latest\\\\\\\">11/7/2026 4:40:05 AM</LastTouched>\\\\r\\\\n      <DeliverySpeed Unit=\\\\\\\"m/s\\\\\\\" Collapse=\\\\\\\"Monotone\\\\\\\">1.17</DeliverySpeed>\\\\r\\\\n      <Driver Collapse=\\\\\\\"Vote\\\\\\\">Gonk</Driver>\\\\r\\\\n      <Deliveries Collapse=\\\\\\\"Sum\\\\\\\">42</Deliveries>\\\\r\\\\n    </Variables>\\\\r\\\\n    <Actions>\\\\r\\\\n      <Action Key=\\\\\\\"30FE3C7D2160E37A\\\\\\\" />\\\\r\\\\n    </Actions>\\\\r\\\\n    <Items>\\\\r\\\\n      <Item Key=\\\\\\\"E3A38F9BDE9312D0\\\\\\\" />\\\\r\\\\n    </Items>\\\\r\\\\n  </Seraphim.Internet.Session>\\\\r\\\\n</Response>\\\",\\\"sent\\\":\\\"<?xml version=\\\\\\\"1.0\\\\\\\" encoding=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"?><xaiml version=\\\\\\\"1\\\\\\\"><name>08 Guarded Flow</name><gorp name=\\\\\\\"08 Guarded Flow\\\\\\\"><comment view=\\\\\\\"class\\\\\\\">A real function block. Gate's function has three numbered steps: step 0 compares level against limit — both in metres, so the guard is legal — and jumps to step 2 when it passes; step 1 refuses; step 2 accepts.\\\\n\\\\nThis is what the State Machine view reads: one state per sequence, one transition per goto. Select Gate and switch to it.</comment><expect>Check finds nothing.\\\\n\\\\nThe State Machine view shows three states and the goto as a guarded transition; the Sequence view shows In into Gate and Gate out to Out.\\\\n\\\\nCompare two different quantities inside the guard and Check must refuse it the way N01 is refused.</expect><model namespace=\\\\\\\"ut.flow.In\\\\\\\"><variables><variable name=\\\\\\\"level\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\"double\\\\\\\" c